  "title": "브라질 의회 DETER 위성도구 사용금지 법안 통과 — 삼림벌채 감시 약화 우려",
  "url": "https://news.mongabay.com/2026/05/brazil-congress-bill-bar-deter-satellite-deforestation-enforcement/",
  "snippet": "Brazil's Congress passed a bill prohibiting environmental agencies (IBAMA/ICMBio) from using satellite images via the DETER system to restrict commercial use of illegally deforested lands. The bill would require in-person inspection instead of satellite-based enforcement. With only 1,250 environmental agents for a forest the size of Western Europe, ground-based enforcement is widely considered impractical. DETER uses Landsat and MODIS satellite data processed by Brazil's INPE.",
